{"id":"n62308-6-5","stage":2,"title":"닿다 · 来到","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62308-6-5-1","ko":"다음에 또 저희 집에 찾아와 주세요.","zh":"下次也请再来我们家吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다음에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음에","audio":"/audio/2a722c75f1d5ba8ef482.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아와","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아와","audio":"/audio/d9e29f5d7f5e02f56812.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae17606ab51cb8cd0104.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62308-6-5-2","ko":"기회가 닿아 서울에 오면 또 연락드리겠습니다.","zh":"有机会来首尔的话，我会再联系您的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"기회가","meaning":"机会，机遇，时机","explanation":"기회：机会，机遇，时机；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"기회","audio":"/audio/1815f64fee30a098d49f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기회가","audio":"/audio/5a2cf36540e9e0d75d4b.mp3"}},{"text":"닿아","meaning":"来到，来临","explanation":"닿다：来到，来临；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"닿다","audio":"/audio/3a114f548ae224cf9b44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62308","senseId":"6","lemma":"닿다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"닿아","audio":"/audio/8148d31f2a1cef28c44e.mp3"}},{"text":"서울에","meaning":"首尔","e